OL,3,GNEWSA'Eyesore' sandbags removed from
OL,4,Acity island
OL,5,
OL,6,FSandbags at one of Derby's busiest
OL,7,Ftraffic hotspots, which had been
OL,8,Fbranded an "eyesore", have been
OL,9,Fremoved.
OL,11,FConcerns were raised that the large
OL,12,Fsacks made Cockpit Island ` one of the
OL,13,Fcity centre's main gateways ` look like
OL,14,Fa "builder's yard".
OL,16,FDerby City Council put them in place
OL,17,Flast year after Stephen Bullock ` also
OL,18,Fknown as "Yellow Caravan Man" and Tiggz
OL,19,FDat Author ` occupied a pavement in the
OL,20,Fmiddle of the island for several
OL,21,Fmonths.
OL,23,APub: 17-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
